{"id":"b4yhhj0w9mvfffgvnvf0ipdsz","title":"巴西某研究团队发现过度运动导致小鼠大脑多巴胺长期异常升高","originalTitle":"Too much exercise could leave your brain stuck in overdrive","summary":"巴西里贝朗普雷托体育教育学校（EEFERP-USP）团队在《Neuroscience》发表研究，通过单次高强度运动和八周渐进式过度训练两组小鼠实验，发现后者多巴胺水平在48小时恢复期仍持续升高，且酪氨酸羟化酶（TyrH）活性同步异常。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"ScienceDaily 健康医学"},"links":{"original":"https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/11/261117033923.htm"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T21:28:29.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T11:41:42.853Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T11:41:42.853Z","category":"neuroscience","tags":["研究成果","脑机接口"],"score":57,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"7d0e1236-abef-423d-902f-c20addadebc1","title":"巴西两研究揭示过度训练致小鼠多巴胺异常升高及潜在健康风险"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"7d0e1236-abef-423d-902f-c20addadebc1","title":"巴西两研究揭示过度训练致小鼠多巴胺异常升高及潜在健康风险"}],"topics":[{"slug":"brain-computer-interface","name":"脑机接口"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fbZMrXv6srH0","reportCount":2,"additionalSourceCount":1},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}